# oracle: pair_style eam/he on PdHHe.eam.he (Zhou et al., Pd-H-He Finnis-Sinclair with rhomin range), fcc 3x3x3 cells (108 atoms) of Pd at a = 3.89 A, 1% H and 1% He on the sites (set type/fraction), 0.05 A random displacements, velocities create 800 K, fix nve, 100 steps; thermo every 20 steps
# oracle-potentials: PdHHe.eam.he
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-9 abs=1e-12
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 2.6e-13, atoms 6.2e-14.
units           metal
atom_style      atomic
lattice         fcc 3.89
region          box block 0 3 0 3 0 3
create_box      3 box
create_atoms    1 box
set             group all type/fraction 2 0.01 1111
set             group all type/fraction 3 0.01 2222
mass            1 106.42
mass            2 1.008
mass            3 4.0026
displace_atoms  all random 0.05 0.05 0.05 4711 units box
pair_style      eam/he
pair_coeff      * * PdHHe.eam.he Pd H He
timestep        0.002
fix             1 all nve
thermo_style    custom step pe ke press pxx pyy pzz pxy pxz pyz
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          20
velocity        all create 800 4928459 rot yes dist gaussian loop geom
run             100
